- op: discuss  # 37b6
  at: '2026-03-06T00:17:22Z'  # 37b6
  by: agent  # 37b6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 37b6
  clock: 3  # 37b6
  nonce: 37b6  # 37b6
  message: "Fixed in PR #1772. Root cause: do_sync() finally block checked out original branch (discarding committed ops) then deleted sync branch (orphaning the commit). Fix: restore ops from sync branch via git checkout before branch deletion."  # 37b6
- op: discuss  # db7e
  at: '2026-05-04T04:49:52Z'  # db7e
  by: agent  # db7e
  actor: jgstern_agent  # db7e
  clock: 4  # db7e
  nonce: db7e  # db7e
  message: "**REGRESSION observed 2026-05-03**, hg-uat-v4.0.0 directed-validation campaign cleanup session.\n\nPR #1772 (this item, merged 2026-03-06) addressed the symptom by restoring ops from the sync branch before deletion in `do_sync()`'s finally block. The same shape of silent-revert recurs as of 2026-05-03.\n\n## Repro\n\nDuring the 8-item lifecycle drain (3 moved + 1 no_move + 4 inconclusive) plus 8 new-item filings = 17 tracker mutations in the same session:\n\n```\n[tracker] Auto-sync is AUTOMATIC — do NOT push or sync manually. 74 pending line(s), threshold=80.\nupdated WI-zojid: tags: -awaits_bakeoff_validation\nauto-sync: 81 lines of tracker changes exceed threshold (80), syncing...\nauto-sync: sync failed (1/3): push failed after 3 attempts\n[tracker] Auto-sync is AUTOMATIC — do NOT push or sync manually. 0 pending line(s), threshold=80.\ndiscussed\n```\n\nAfter auto-sync (failed-push path), three operations across the WI-kivut → WI-zojid → WI-sokaz boundary were silently lost despite the CLI reporting them as applied:\n\n1. `tracker update WI-kivut --remove-tag awaits_bakeoff_validation` — CLI: \"tags: -awaits_bakeoff_validation\". Compiled state: tag still present.\n2. `tracker update WI-zojid --remove-tag awaits_bakeoff_validation` — CLI: \"tags: -awaits_bakeoff_validation\". Compiled state: tag still present.\n3. `tracker update WI-sokaz --parent WI-gupah` — CLI: \"now child of WI-gupah (...)\". Compiled state: parent: null.\n\nAll three were detected by reading back state via `tracker show` and cross-checking against the action log. Each was **idempotently reapplyable** — re-issuing produced the correct compiled state.\n\n## Differences from the 2026-03 incident\n\n| Dimension | 2026-03 (described in original) | 2026-05 (this regression) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Scale | 15 of 16 ops lost | 3 of 17 ops lost |\n| Distribution | Bulk loss | Selective: only ops adjacent to the auto-sync boundary |\n| Push-failure cause | Codeberg outage | Push failed 3× (cause not investigated) |\n| Symptom shape | Failed push → ops files reverted | Failed push → CLI reports applied, compiled state reverted |\n\nThe selective-loss pattern in the 2026-05 incident suggests the failure mode may be subtly different from the 2026-03 one — possibly the do_sync finally block is now correctly preserving the *committed* ops, but the *uncommitted* tail of the in-flight mutation batch is being dropped during the rebase-restore. The three lost ops were the ones at or adjacent to the threshold-crossing boundary (74 → 81 pending lines).\n\n## State at session end\n\nThe tracker is currently in **circuit-breaker-open** mode (~28 min remaining at the time of writing) so auto-sync is paused. Local ops queue up on disk; once the breaker resets the next mutation will trigger another sync attempt.\n\n## Reopening\n\nPer AGENTS.md tracker resolution rationale rules, recording the regression here. **Reopening status to `todo_hard`** so the work item surfaces in `tracker ready` and `count-todos`. Keeping P1 — silent data loss in the agent's primary state-mutation path is a high-severity issue.\n\n## Suggested investigation hooks\n\n1. Instrument `do_sync()` to log the exact ops files present in the working tree at each stage (pre-sync, post-checkout, post-restore).\n2. Reproduce by setting an unreachable git remote and intentionally crossing the 80-line threshold mid-batch.\n3. Compare the 2026-05-03 sequence (mutations interleaved across the threshold) against the 2026-03 reproduction case (bulk batch).\n\nMaster report context: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/hg-uat-v4.0.0/lab-notebook/master-report.md"  # db7e
