- op: discuss  # da34
  at: '2026-05-04T07:28:58Z'  # da34
  by: agent  # da34
  actor: jgstern_agent  # da34
  clock: 8  # da34
  nonce: da34  # da34
  message: "Fixed in PR #3540 (commit 63f59b0a9). Root cause: do_sync()'s finally-block cleanup (git checkout HEAD -- .ops/ + ls-files --others + unlink + ff-merge) ran unconditionally, wiping local ops on every failure path. Gated the destructive branch on a new merge_succeeded flag set only after the merge call returns True. Failed syncs now leave the working tree intact so the next mutation re-triggers sync against the same content."  # da34
